5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and patience. I believe we should look closely at the human element that sustains our research.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that the human element is vital. I also think we should consider how the actual purchasing power of these grants is shifting over time.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited to be here! I think we should check how the shared tools and facilities are doing. If the equipment is worn out, it doesn't matter how great the plan is, right?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. While the human and technical elements are indeed vital, I believe we should also consider the practicalities of execution to ensure the science isn't sidelined by administrative friction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. It is important to ensure that the proposed timelines are realistic and that the outcomes are tangible. We should look at the actual delivery of past projects to inform our current choice.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. To understand the strength of a project, we must see who is truly there to do the work. I shall examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a very thorough approach, Servas. To understand the current costs, I would like to look into the national computing agreement and facility day rates, as well as the travel and bench-fee lines.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,That makes sense! I'll look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation. I want to see if the machines are actually working and available!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent selection, Kenji. To complement your technical focus, I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the closeout files of finished awards. I suspect the ghosts of past delays may haunt us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I want to see which types of projects actually delivered their promised results on time.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a balanced plan. By looking at the people, the costs, the tools, and the history, we shall find a path that honors both the science and the scientists.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. It feels like we are covering all the necessary bases. I look forward to seeing what we discover and how it helps us make a fair decision for the candidates.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just so curious to see what's actually happening in those labs! I hope the equipment is in good shape so the winners can get straight to the cool stuff. This is going to be great!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. Your enthusiasm is quite infectious. I only hope the records are as tidy as your optimism, otherwise, we may find ourselves navigating a labyrinth of bureaucratic mishaps.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Tidiness is rarely a guarantee in these records. However, the patterns they reveal are what matter. I believe the data will provide the clarity we need to avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us hold onto that hope for clarity. Patience is a virtue that reveals the truth in any record. I am content with our choices; let us now see what the archives reveal to us.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. I hope the information we find allows us to support the researchers in a way that is truly sustainable. I am ready to move forward and see the results.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I can't wait to see if the facilities are ready for some awesome new research. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Let us proceed to the findings. I shall be quite interested to see if the administrative friction I suspect is a systemic habit or merely a series of unfortunate coincidences.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am also ready. Let us see if the evidence aligns with our expectations or if it warns us of a different reality. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
